    "reason": "The only evidence is a one-line changelog entry [ev-f7d3abb12e99]. It says metrics now \"support gRPC and gRPC-Web protocol\" but not what that concretely means: which metrics change, whether a protocol label gains new values or existing gRPC traffic gets a different label, and what configuration exposes an environment. The two proposals read it differently (P1: protocol support in metrics; P2: metrics endpoints accepting gRPC requests), which shows how ambiguous it is. The surrounding Enhancements section adds nothing on this item. Linked PR #9483 or the metrics docs would be needed to define who is exposed.",
